1
00:00:03,623 --> 00:00:08,689
Long ago, there was a boy who loved to play.

2
00:00:09,102 --> 00:00:18,250
Once scolded by mother, he left, not thinking of mother at all.

3
00:00:18,250 --> 00:00:25,910
One day beaten by older children, he then remembered mother.

4
00:00:25,910 --> 00:00:38,253
When going home, not seeing mother anywhere, he hugged a green tree in the garden and cried.

5
00:00:38,253 --> 00:00:42,694
Fruit on tree fell into his hand.

6
00:00:42,694 --> 00:00:56,104
His lips just touched, a stream of white milk flowed out, sweet fragrant like mother's milk.

7
00:00:56,104 --> 00:00:59,727
He cried loudly.

8
00:00:59,727 --> 00:01:08,931
The tree spread branches to hug him like mother's gentle hands patting him.

9
00:01:08,931 --> 00:01:20,448
Later, people call it milk tree.

